+---
+name: scrapling
+description: Web scraping with Scrapling - HTTP fetching, stealth browser automation, Cloudflare bypass, and spider crawling via CLI and Python.
+version: 1.0.0
+author: FEUAZUR
+license: MIT
+metadata:
